{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":10},"68, mon père et les clous","Ouverte il y a 30 ans, en plein Quartier Latin, la quincaillerie de mon père est un haut lieu de sociabilité. C’est aussi l’ancien terrain de jeu de mon enfance. Bricomonge va fermer. A l’heure de l’inventaire et des comptes, j’accompagne mon père dans les derniers moments du magasin. Et je cherche à comprendre ce qui a amené le militant maoïste qu’il était dans les années 60-70, intellectuel diplômé, à vendre des clous.",[4,5,6,7,8,9],"self-employment","personal memory","urban","parenthood","activism","disappearing professions",{"type":11,"id":12,"slug":13,"title":14,"release":16,"filmType":20,"directors":21,"genre":29,"media":32,"synopsis":35,"production":36,"characters":39,"roles":40,"awards":45,"tags":3},"Film","FR2019_083","fr2019-083-68-mon-pere-et-les-clous",{"native":1,"english":15},"",{"type":17,"date":18,"year":19},"Theatrical release","2019-05-01",2019,"Documentary",[22],{"id":23,"slug":24,"name":23,"birthYear":25,"deathYear":25,"gender":26,"nationality":27,"awards":28},"Samuel Bigiaoui","samuel-bigiaoui",0,"Male identifying","France",[],[30,31],"Documentary – Performative mode","Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":33,"trailerUrl":34},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/226/28/204002/format_page/68-mon-pere-et-les-clous.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ddzO1TwuG-0",{"native":2,"english":15},[37],{"country":27,"share":38},"Majority coproducer",[],[41],{"person":42,"role":44},{"id":23,"slug":24,"name":23,"birthYear":25,"deathYear":25,"gender":26,"nationality":27,"awards":43},[],"Director of the film",[46],{"person":47,"year":48,"award":49,"category":50,"result":51},null,2020,"César du cinéma","Best Documentary Film","Nominated"],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
